# =============================================================================
# .gitignore — what is DELIBERATELY tracked matters more than what is ignored.
# =============================================================================
#
# TRACKED ON PURPOSE, do not add these:
#
#   research/results/       the printed report + result blocks of every run, as
#                           the harness wrote them. A logged number must be
#                           traceable to the bytes that produced it.
#   osap_source/cache/      the OSAP specs and predictor source at the pinned
#                           `osap_source.ref`, so a factor's input survives the
#                           upstream repo's history.
#   data/SNAPSHOT_MANIFEST.yaml
#                           per-table sha256, row counts and date ranges of the
#                           frozen Sharadar snapshot. DATA_SHA is derived from
#                           it. The manifest is the provenance; the bytes are not.
#
# NEVER TRACKED:
#
#   data/sharadar/          the Sharadar snapshot itself (licensed, multi-GB).
#   data/cache/             derived panels, rebuilt from the snapshot on demand.
# =============================================================================

data/sharadar/*
!data/sharadar/.gitkeep
data/cache/*
!data/cache/.gitkeep

# Python build artefacts
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.pytest_cache/

# Editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*.swp

# Secrets — never commit. The Sharadar API key lives in .env / the environment.
.env
*.pem
*.key

# transient
data/download.log
.claude/worktrees/
